    author: 'Bahá\'u\'lláh',
    text: 'He is the Supreme Controller over His servants.\n\nAll praise be to God, the Lord of all worlds. The religion of God and His Cause are a mighty stronghold. Its ways are ways of goodly deeds and virtuous character. The adornment of men is contentment, trustworthiness and that which the Almighty hath destined for His servants. The best thing for man is that he should leave this mortal world with pure deeds and a clean heart.',
